# Secrets — never commit.
# Patterns are deliberately broad: a file named .deploy-secrets.env once slipped
# past `.env`/`.env.*` and reached a public repo. Match anything secret-shaped.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
!example.env
*secret*
*secrets*
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
*-service-account*.json
*.pem
*.key

